  "notes": "First issue released with custom labels, EMI Gang Of 4 design on side-A and an image printed on side-B. Later editions have Gang Of 4 design on both sides.\nIncludes an inner sleeve with rounded corners, printed credits, lyric and notes.\nSpine is red with band name, album title and catalog number in blue ink.\n\nRecorded at the Workhouse Old Kent Road\nLyrics Copyright EMI Music.\n\n℗ 1979 Gang Of Four\n\nPlease note that track B4 is printed on label side B as: 'At home he's a tourist (Packet)'\n\nRunouts: 'YAX 5658 - 1U' and \"YAX 5659 - 1U\" are stamped, the rest etched.",
  "released_formatted": "25 Sep 1979",
